From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:22:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] perf(client): cache station lookups by block position

Signs, PIDS and station name blocks called findStation every frame, which
streamed over every client station. Cache the result per block position,
including misses, in the client data instance. Core applies every station
update, addition and removal before calling sync(), which now drops the
cache; a data reset or world change replaces the instance. The lookup keeps
the first matching station in the same iteration order, and positions
outside the packed key range are looked up directly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TD7PJ5R7t7hM3ymeeqXP4H
